  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Civil Service commission in collaboration with UNDP.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Capacity of government institutions enabled to deliver improved basic services, respond to priorities voiced by the public and promote accountability and participation at local levels. The project is expected to deliver on the following outputs: i) a civil service reform roadmap, ii) merit-based civil service system initiatives, and iii) service delivery improvement (experimentation) in selected sectors and service units.</narrative>
  </description>
